      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In discussions with them, it would appear somehow today, instead of being taken to the VRChat SSO login required page, they were taken to a page with the normal Canny login options ( e.g https://canny.io/login ) — using the same email & password as their VRChat account in the onsite Canny login resulted in successfully logging in.\n\nHowever this is not a solution, as there is the concern that they will lose access once the cookie expires, considering the default Canny login page is not normally accessible and was purposefully hidden after the update to use SSO with VRChat accounts.\n\nThere seems to have been an issue merging their Canny account with their VRChat account in this case.",
