  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "For literal years now, I could not log into the canny because I got this screen instead when I authorised my VRChat account. The button, would send me to the authorisation screen, and on clicking \"Authorize\", would be sent back to this screen in an endless loop. Only today did I luck out and was able to log in.",
